  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "While trying to determine if Fedora supported unicode in binary filenames, I have seen some inconsistent behaviors. This applies to fedora 5 and 6.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Putting some chinese characters directly in as the filename gives good results in the response Content-Disposition, but not the binary description:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "java"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "curl -H'Link: <http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#NonRDFSource>; rel=\"type\"' --data-binary @README.md -H'Content-Disposition: attachment; filename=\"浅顶软呢帽岩石\"' -H\"Content-type: text/plain\" -XPOST http://localhost:8080/rest/ -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin\r\n\r\ncurl -I http://localhost:8080/rest/90703ac5-191e-48d8-84a9-17300e490520 -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin\r\n\r\n# Content-Disposition: attachment; filename=\"浅顶软呢帽岩石\"; creation-date=\"Thu, 15 Apr 2021 21:00:28 GMT\"; modification-date=\"Thu, 15 Apr 2021 21:00:28 GMT\"; size=4719\r\n\r\ncurl http://localhost:8080/rest/90703ac5-191e-48d8-84a9-17300e490520/fcr:metadata -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin\r\n\r\n<http://localhost:8080/rest/90703ac5-191e-48d8-84a9-17300e490520>\r\n        ebucore:filename         \"æµé¡¶è½¯å¢å¸½å²©ç³\" ;",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "You are supposed to be able to define the encoding of the filename using \"Content-Disposition: attachment; filename*=UTF-8...\" form (note, it is filename* rather than filename), but this is simply ignored by fedora. In FedoraLdp it actually parses within the contentDisposition object, but the filename* value is stored as a parameter instead of as the filename, so its not found by the controller code.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "java"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "curl -H'Link: <http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#NonRDFSource>; rel=\"type\"' --data-binary @README.md -H\"Content-Disposition: attachment; filename*=UTF-8''%e6%b5%85%e9%a1%b6%e8%bd%af%e5%91%a2%e5%b8%bd%e5%b2%a9%e7%9f%b3\" -H\"Content-type: text/plain\" -XPOST http://localhost:8080/rest/ -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin\r\n\r\ncurl -I http://localhost:8080/rest/058ac0ce-ecf6-4afe-9b18-f68e5c8e5da3 -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin\r\n\r\n# Content-Disposition: attachment; creation-date=\"Thu, 15 Apr 2021 21:07:16 GMT\"; modification-date=\"Thu, 15 Apr 2021 21:07:16 GMT\"; size=4719",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    }
   ],
